==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|en}} {{m|fro|malison}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|maledictiō}}, from the past participle stem of {{m|la|maledīcō||I speak ill of}}, from {{m|la|male||wickedly, badly}} + {{m|la|dīcō||say, speak}}. Compare {{m|en|malediction}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈmælɪzən/|/ˈmælɪsən/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
